  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b5b9510ab6831d0a814fcaf8f0fdaf835b01a81e1bb877308c38abf409a097eb",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a43cbc4bf3b5b379eb8f3c9aeadd9c29ffc42f1f0527c4eae08247ddc0339be2",
      "text": "悟空的\n雪地弯弯",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3cef2ef4c7427f85424125ddf2e441021e15c4544e9a632c6ee1a887b192587f",
      "text": "玉兔挥挥手。\n“欢迎你，悟空！”\n“欢迎你，铁扇公主！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c02f0e64207c646c53fbab7a762ed87f67ebb92685c4a0842292f147cbfe640b",
      "text": "金箍棒和铁扇子，\n都收进小柜子里。\n穿好雪靴，踩上雪板。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "213215965a0e34e47b1903eea2bd74002441b0b4e8b5490713f621b4f0c32a28",
      "text": "“我的脚变长啦！”\n悟空摇摇晃晃，\n两块雪板滑向两边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c363713721ad10da7e1e0efbf57af1cffb10d5e13a53870cd9e2579b0cb6bb3f",
      "text": "水獭教练检查每顶头盔。\n“先在小缓坡上练习哦。”\n大家认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d2f1418fb332edb7fc24624985fbd72c49f8bfab3541c292b20a2924c218f6e",
      "text": "悟空迈得太快啦。\n扑通！坐进软软的雪里。\n尾巴上顶着一个雪球。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16a98a3bb94d94af0108ec023c4888d378aace40f0d190a4ff7a5f0fe0767ace",
      "text": "铁扇公主坐进软雪里。\n“皇家雪坐垫！”\n她哈哈大笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1281c2481ead2013b2d9195e51a95e93cfb1f7bff2e754123764d72cf8f3d171",
      "text": "她“唰”地停下来。\n再看看前面的弯道——\n那个弯好大呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44ae875725ac7631426ae022fd1a310b9bcfaf9e6f4afd045fd157e42adc77bd",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖。\n“小脚，慢一点！”\n他抬头看向坡下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2745e03803dc89860dd81088775cb3f390de4d70652dcb0b8a3746c41d453d1e",
      "text": "教练用小旗标出宽宽的路。\n玉兔在旁边喊：“慢慢来！”\n悟空认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b2d2dbba1af1936244efe80b12e763895e047374df5427cd225477d9e3b0e83",
      "text": "铁扇公主慢慢呼了口气。\n弯弯膝盖，转个小弯，\n雪板绕过了小旗。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "951cd93716732fe10e2a4f0c5522adbf450b8e18e9ca1f8e776cb062eeae94fa",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖，转个弯。\n“慢慢滑。转个弯。停！”\n他停在小旗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9eaccf4ed3975d291f6107c80770c2bcc2b8e4db079d0401cc65d070065b7e0d",
      "text": "他们回头看。\n雪地上，两条弯弯的线\n交叉在一起。\n“像两条丝带！”玉兔喊。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d90600401c1b20cc0609cf3310952025949804a2d4d67d364cc7d26098d33a87",
      "text": "三杯暖暖的热可可，\n一碗小鱼饼干。\n吹一吹，小口喝，小口喝。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "36210862202c4a80cd69364f2b4ae8a6aa7e74fd7541a9a3e716a983f40f225f",
      "text": "“我的小鱼不会滑雪！”\n“我的小鱼会游泳……\n游进我的肚子里！”\n咔嚓，咔嚓。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3fbff4fc8ff0542847a465b5b4381114f2554a6d0fae98ba03280384d68cae65",
      "text": "他们画下弯弯的滑雪路线。\n玉兔添上小小的雪花。\n窗外，雪花轻轻飘。\n屋里，可可还暖暖的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画使用 AI 辅助创作，由作者指导和编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
